{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the trial version, players will act as intern traders at an investment institution. Completing mentor tasks will lead to a full-time position, followed by even greater challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The markets in the trial version are divided into:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>Main Board</strong>: T+1 settlement, \u00b110% price limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>New Board</strong>: T+0 settlement, \u00b150% price limit.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which index performs better? Which has a stronger profit effect?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(T+1: Positions bought on the same day can only be sold the next day; T+0: Positions can be freely bought and sold on the same day.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The trial version includes the first 3 chapters of the level-based mode, with 5 levels in each chapter.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3974630?t=1760682030","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974630/3c37415c20abe5b1a3f4cff1c76ecc8a865e57bb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760682030","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974630/56f6191069ba7da9e279357f4d9237777c4e97a1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760682030","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974630/56f6191069ba7da9e279357f4d9237777c4e97a1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760682030","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the trial version, players will act as intern traders at an investment institution. Completing mentor tasks will lead to a full-time position, followed by even greater challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The markets in the trial version are divided into:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>Main Board</strong>: T+1 settlement, \u00b110% price limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>New Board</strong>: T+0 settlement, \u00b150% price limit.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which index performs better? Which has a stronger profit effect?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(T+1: Positions bought on the same day can only be sold the next day; T+0: Positions can be freely bought and sold on the same day.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The trial version includes the first 3 chapters of the level-based mode, with 5 levels in each chapter.</p>","developers":["LoneCat"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3956480","name":"Stocks: Main Force Simulator"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974630/30f68b0e783056174fcd2abf72dd54bb3fbf9092/header.jpg?t=1760682030","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS High Sierra 10.14 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon or Intel<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3974630/985755061/f37b051b5da0d38ba96e9e12e466b3561da9d340/1759852281/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760350030","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.